+These models are registered with text, tool calling and schema support. Image, PDF and audio attachments and reasoning options are not enabled by default because support depends on the target model; once you have confirmed a model supports them, register it in `extra-openai-models.yaml` (see below) with `vision: true` or `reasoning: true`. Entries in that file without an `api_base` are served by Router using the Responses API.
